title:loader
---
<<if $quest_complete>>
    <<jump quest_done>>
<<elseif $kids_found >= 7>>
    <<jump quest_turn_in>>
<<elseif $quest_start>>
    <<jump quest_repeat>>
<<elseif $met_capsule>>
    <<jump repeat>>
<<else>>
    <<jump introduction>>
<<endif>>
===

title: introduction
color: blue
position: -388,-182
---
NestedParentArmature_Unpack: Hey.
Capsule: Oh, hello!
Capsule: I didn't see you there.
NestedParentArmature_Unpack: Really? 
NestedParentArmature_Unpack: I walked right through the front entrance. I wasn't trying to hide or anything.
Capsule: I was facing the other way. 
NestedParentArmature_Unpack: What?
NestedParentArmature_Unpack: Oh. Right, you are a capsule. I can't really tell what direction you are facing.
Capsule: Well, I'm facing towards you now.
NestedParentArmature_Unpack: Right.
NestedParentArmature_Unpack: Well, whats your name?
Capsule: My name is Capsule.
NestedParentArmature_Unpack: I should've guessed. 
NestedParentArmature_Unpack: Thats a neat name.
Capsule: Thanks. How about you?
NestedParentArmature_Unpack: Oh me? My names NestedParentArmature_Unpack. 
NestedParentArmature_Unpack: But my friends call me NPA for short. Heh.
Capsule: Do they really?
NestedParentArmature_Unpack: No. I don't have friends.
Capsule: Oh. 
Capsule: Well, we can be friends if you want. 
NestedParentArmature_Unpack: Really? Awesome. 
<<set $met_capsule to true>>
<<jump repeat>>
